00:12:38.803 --> 00:12:41.033
Hasil dari prosedur terakhir.

00:12:41.773 --> 00:12:43.741
Dia semakin buruk, Donald.

00:12:44.409 --> 00:12:46.240
Kamu ingin masuk kembali?

00:12:47.278 --> 00:12:48.836
Katakan padaku.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:59.581
Anatomi vaskularnya terlalu rumit
